                <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4">Why Regular Health Checkup is Important at Sunrise Clinic?</h2>
                <div class="mb-4" itemprop="step" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/HowToStep">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold"><i class="fas fa-search text-primary me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i><span itemprop="name">Early Disease Detection</span></h5>
                    <p class="text-muted" itemprop="text">Identify health issues like diabetes, hypertension, thyroid problems early with tests like HbA1C (₹1000), TSH (₹800), Lipid Profile (₹1200) at Sunrise Clinic.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="mb-4" itemprop="step" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/HowToStep">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-success me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i><span itemprop="name">Preventive Healthcare</span></h5>
                    <p class="text-muted" itemprop="text">Prevent serious diseases with regular CBC (₹500), Liver Function tests (₹500), Kidney Function tests (₹500) and customized packages at Sunrise Clinic Pabna.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="mb-4" itemprop="step" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/HowToStep">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold"><i class="fas fa-chart-line text-info me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i><span itemprop="name">Health Progress Monitoring</span></h5>
                    <p class="text-muted" itemprop="text">Track your health progress with regular checkups at Sunrise Clinic and adjust lifestyle based on accurate diagnostic test results from our advanced laboratory.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <img src="/img/preventive-care.svg" alt="Importance of Preventive Health Checkup at Sunrise Clinic"
                     class="img-fluid rounded" itemprop="image" loading="lazy">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ Section -->
<section class="py-5 bg-light" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">Frequently Asked Questions about Health Checkup</h2>
            <p class="text-muted">Common questions about health checkups at Sunrise Clinic Pabna</p>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion" id="checkupFAQ">
            <div class="accordion-item" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq1">
                        <span itemprop="name">How often should I get a health checkup at Sunrise Clinic?</span>
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="faq1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#checkupFAQ"
                     itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
                    <div class="accordion-body" itemprop="text">
                        For healthy adults, an annual checkup is recommended at Sunrise Clinic. However, if you have existing health conditions or are above 40, you might need checkups every 6 months with our Basic Health Checkup package (₹1200).
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq2">
                        <span itemprop="name">Do I need to fast before health checkup at Sunrise Clinic?</span>
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="faq2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#checkupFAQ"
                     itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
                    <div class="accordion-body" itemprop="text">
                        Yes, for most blood tests like FBS (₹150), Lipid Profile (₹1200) you need to fast for 8-12 hours before visiting Sunrise Clinic. Only water is allowed during fasting period. Non-fasting tests include CBC (₹500), ECG (₹300).
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq3">
                        <span itemprop="name">How long does it take to get health checkup results at Sunrise Clinic?</span>
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="faq3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#checkupFAQ"
                     itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
                    <div class="accordion-body" itemprop="text">
                        Most blood test results are available within 4-6 hours at Sunrise Clinic. Special tests like Hormone tests (FSH/LH ₹1200) may take 24 hours. X-Ray (₹500-700) and USG (₹1000-1500) reports are immediate at our clinic in Pabna.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq4">
                        <span itemprop="name">Can I get individual tests instead of package at Sunrise Clinic?</span>
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="faq4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#checkupFAQ"
                     itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
                    <div class="accordion-body" itemprop="text">
                        Yes, you can book individual tests like CBC (₹500), ECG (₹300), USG (₹1000-1500) etc. at Sunrise Clinic Pabna. Packages offer better value with savings: Basic Health Checkup saves ₹300, Diabetes Package saves ₹500, Fever Profile saves ₹400.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .hero-section-c {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(13, 110, 253, 0.1) 0%, rgba(25, 135, 84, 0.1) 100%);
        padding: 80px 0;
    }

    .card-hover {
        transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }

        .card-hover:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
        }

    .accordion-button:not(.collapsed) {
        background-color: rgba(13, 110, 253, 0.1);
        color: #0d6efd;
    }

    .badge {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        padding: 4px 8px;
    }
</style>

@section Scripts {
    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
            const scrolltomain = document.getElementById('checkup');
            if (scrolltomain) {
                scrolltomain.classList.add('scroll-target');
                scrolltomain.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' });
            }

            // SEO: Track package clicks
            document.querySelectorAll('a[href*="package="]').forEach(packageLink => {
                packageLink.addEventListener('click', function() {
                    const packageName = this.closest('.card').querySelector('h4').textContent.trim();
                    const packagePrice = this.closest('.card').querySelector('.display-5').textContent.trim();
                    console.log('SEO: Health Checkup Package clicked:', packageName, packagePrice);

                    // Google Analytics event tracking
                    if (typeof gtag !== 'undefined') {
                        gtag('event', 'package_click', {
                            'event_category': 'Checkup',
                            'event_label': packageName,
                            'value': parseInt(packagePrice.replace('₹', ''))
                        });
                    }
                });
            });

            console.log('SEO: Health Checkup Page Loaded - Sunrise Clinic Pabna');
        });
    </script>
}